  description: '1 "GMX" monster + 1 Dinosaur monster

    Each time your opponent
    Normal or Special Summons a monster(s), gain 200 LP. During your opponent''s
    turn (Quick Effect): You can target 1 card your opponent controls; excavate the
    top cards of your Deck until you excavate a "GMX" monster or a Dinosaur monster,
    lose 400 LP for each excavated card, add that "GMX" or Dinosaur monster to your
    hand or Special Summon it, and shuffle the rest into the Deck. Also, after that,
    destroy the targeted card. You can only use this effect of "GMX - VELOX" once
    per turn.'
